{
  "title": "双月报来了！万里数据库8-9月持续开展全链路国产兼容适配",
  "description": "",
  "content": "<div class=\"newsxq\"> <div class=\"fhan\"> <div class=\"container\"> <p><a href=\"javascript:;\" onclick=\"javascript:history.back(-1);return false;\">返回<img src=\"../../../../static/home/images/tu14.png\" alt=\"\" /></a></p> </div> </div> <div class=\"xq_nr\"> <div class=\"container\"> <div class=\"xqnr\"> <div class=\"xq_l\"> <div class=\"xq_rq\"><span>31</span><font>2024.10</font></div> <div class=\"xq_l_l\"> <h2>双月报来了！万里数据库8-9月持续开展全链路国产兼容适配</h2> <b>2024.10.31</b> <p><img src=\"https://p3-sign.toutiaoimg.com/tos-cn-i-axegupay5k/0ce4bd17ad1e4189b6fb336abfe0acd1~noop.image?_iz=58558&from=article.pc_detail&lk3s=953192f4&x-expires=1730974602&x-signature=yQHTydh13tG2NoAMWtYDmCaxpVQ%3D\" class=\"syl-page-img\"/></p><p class=\"pgc-img-caption\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px !important;\"><br/></p><p class=\"pgc-p syl-page-br\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 18px; margin-bottom: 18px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; height: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; text-align: justify; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br/></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 24px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; text-align: justify; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1;\">在过去的8-9月，万里数据库先后与龙芯中科、兆芯、麒麟信安、广电五舟、中移物联网及卓望数码等10家生态厂商完成近30款产品的兼容适配工作，进一步加强了国产基础软硬件生态建设，稳固操作系统、CPU及服务器等底层生态链条合作。</p><p class=\"pgc-p syl-page-br\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 18px; margin-bottom: 18px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; height: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; text-align: justify; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1;\"><br/></p><p><img src=\"https://p3-sign.toutiaoimg.com/tos-cn-i-6w9my0ksvp/048145d60d684f32bafeb9c905fe779d~noop.image?_iz=58558&from=article.pc_detail&lk3s=953192f4&x-expires=1730974602&x-signature=lbYYbhXflUJ39iNOYtwLTj1NuOo%3D\" class=\"syl-page-img\" width=\"784\" height=\"715\"/></p><p class=\"pgc-img-caption\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px !important;\"><br/></p><p class=\"pgc-p syl-page-br\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 18px; margin-bottom: 18px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; height: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; text-align: justify; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br/></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; text-align: justify; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">此次适配产品覆盖<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\">操作系统、服务器、CPU、云平台、安全产品、工具类及应用软件</span>等多个产业链环节，并且与操作系统、服务器及CPU等重要生态伙伴的最新型号产品完成了适配认证，体现了万里数据库在生态体系建设上的高效及时性、持续投入性与产品的高度兼容性。</p><p><img src=\"https://p3-sign.toutiaoimg.com/tos-cn-i-6w9my0ksvp/ee3b85ccec2a4bab8ca8be0f22e6814c~noop.image?_iz=58558&from=article.pc_detail&lk3s=953192f4&x-expires=1730974602&x-signature=hPt%2BhIEM4sRnDQvM38O4hx8Yf2k%3D\" class=\"syl-page-img\" width=\"772\" height=\"1254\"/></p><p class=\"pgc-img-caption\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px !important;\"><br/></p><p><img src=\"https://p3-sign.toutiaoimg.com/tos-cn-i-6w9my0ksvp/55392b2404e5494aac1da1e1f89cff48~noop.image?_iz=58558&from=article.pc_detail&lk3s=953192f4&x-expires=1730974602&x-signature=iW8DQ7HBRVnrN24VusDiuRGVf0U%3D\" class=\"syl-page-img\" width=\"761\" height=\"494\"/></p><p class=\"pgc-img-caption\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px !important;\"><br/></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\">安全产品全栈适配 护航数字经济健康安全发展</span></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; text-align: justify; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">值得一提的是，万里数据库在此期间与<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\">卓望数码</span>全栈<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(184, 50, 50); --tt-darkmode-color: #B83232;\">14</span></span>款产品完成了兼容适配，涵盖<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\">安全电子签单系统、安全网关、数码服务器密码机、密钥管理系统、云服务器密码机、时间戳服务器及透明加密系统</span>等主流安全系列产品。</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; text-align: justify; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">在兼容适配的基础上，万里数据库未来将联合卓望数码，为重点行业客户的信息安全提供更加坚固的产品技术防线，为我国数字经济健康安全发展增添砝码。</p><p><img src=\"https://p3-sign.toutiaoimg.com/tos-cn-i-6w9my0ksvp/0da522cb8f644b8ab498099824059cc2~noop.image?_iz=58558&from=article.pc_detail&lk3s=953192f4&x-expires=1730974602&x-signature=UFwp6FiB0IBB9VSCMD%2B7sI79MXk%3D\" class=\"syl-page-img\" width=\"765\" height=\"1229\"/></p><p class=\"pgc-img-caption\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; position: relative; text-align: center; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">▲万里数据库与卓望数码14款主流产品适配（部分图）</p><p class=\"pgc-p syl-page-br\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 18px; margin-bottom: 18px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; height: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; text-align: justify; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br/></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; text-align: justify; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">数据库作为信息化的核心环节，是底层硬件基础资源和上层应用之间的重要支撑。作为国产数据库知名厂商，截至目前，万里数据库与超过400家国产上下游生态伙伴进行了持续不间断的兼容适配工作，展现了万里数据库产品的成熟度、高度兼容性，以及公司建设与拓展国产生态体系的决心与实力，为万里数据库与多方生态伙伴在关键基础设施建设、重点行业应用、云原生领域、信创背景下展开更广泛的产品项目合作奠定基础。</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; text-align: justify; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin-bottom: 0px !important;\">着眼未来，万里数据库将始终聚焦数据库核心技术，持续提高产品适配兼容能力，进一步加速国产生态圈建设步伐，持续发挥技术优势，携手生态合作伙伴在底层通用的数据库基础软件领域协同创新、联合攻关，致力于成为客户最信赖的数据库产品供应商，助力自主可信生态链产业化发展。</p><p><br/></p> </div> </div> <div class=\"xq_r\"> <dl> <a href=\"874.html\"> <dt><span>05</span><font>2025.12</font></dt> <dd> <h2>展会 | GreatSQL精彩亮相GOTC 2025 共建开源数据库生态新未来</h2> <font>2025.12.05</font> <p></p> </dd> </a> </dl> <dl> <a href=\"873.html\"> <dt><span>05</span><font>2025.12</font></dt> <dd> <h2>解决方案 | 200+系统信创改造！万里数据库助力中信银行信用卡中心实现高效平滑迁移</h2> <font>2025.12.05</font> <p></p> </dd> </a> </dl> <dl> <a href=\"872.html\"> <dt><span>05</span><font>2025.12</font></dt> <dd> <h2>喜报｜中国移动中标三连！万里数据库彰显全域布局实力</h2> <font>2025.12.05</font> <p></p> </dd> </a> </dl> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div>",
